f=\"#migrate-now-on-httpmigrationtreveexyz-\" class=\"hash-link\" aria-label=\"Direct link to migrate-now-on-httpmigrationtreveexyz-\" title=\"Direct link to migrate-now-on-httpmigrationtreveexyz-\" translate=\"no\">\u200b</a></h2>\n<h4 class=\"anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq\" id=\"all-pal-that-were-staked-and-locked-will-be-mass-unlocked-soon-during-this-time-you-can-claim-your-accumulated-pal-rewards-and-migrate\">All <a href=\"https://x.com/search?q=%24PAL&amp;src=cashtag_click\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"\">$PAL</a> that were Staked and Locked will be Mass-unlocked soon, during this time, you can claim your accumulated <a href=\"https://x.com/search?q=%24PAL&amp;src=cashtag_click\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"\">$PAL</a> Rewards and migrate.<a href=\"#all-pal-that-were-staked-and-locked-will-be-mass-unlocked-soon-during-this-time-you-can-claim-your-accumulated-pal-rewards-and-migrate\" class=\"hash-link\" aria-label=\"Direct link to all-pal-that-were-staked-and-locked-will-be-mass-unlocked-soon-during-this-time-you-can-claim-your-accumulated-pal-rewards-and-migrate\" title=\"Direct link to all-pal-that-were-staked-and-locked-will-be-mass-unlocked-soon-during-this-time-you-can-claim-your-accumulated-pal-rewards-and-migrate\" translate=\"no\">\u200b</a></h4>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/images/image-kbzpbD-e786a1ac4b8e6b84662bfbb115d223e3.png\" width=\"905\" height=\"510\" class=\"img_ev3q\"></p>\n<p>The <a href=\"https://x.com/search?q=%24PAL&amp;src=cashtag_click\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"\">$PAL</a> to <a href=\"https://x.com/search?q=%24TREVEE&amp;src=cashtag_click\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"\">$TREVEE</a> token migration is LIVE! Following Paladin\u2019s rebrand to Trevee &amp; governance proposals, this aligns the product &amp; token with a simplified tokenomic: staking, buybacks, &amp; excess revenue distribution.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/search?q=%24TREVEE&amp;src=cashtag_click\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"\">$TREVEE</a> migration starts Today! You have 1 year to send old <a href=\"https://x.com/search?q=%24PAL&amp;src=cashtag_click\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"\">$PAL</a> tokens to the migration contract. </p>\n<p>Option 1: Get 100%, Stake for 80 days </p>\n<p>Option 2: Get 75% tokens but fully liquid</p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/images/image-2xeB4v-d50345cd4c75dee339fb344073e7050d.png\" width=\"1095\" height=\"616\" class=\"img_ev3q\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/search?q=%24TREVEE&amp;src=cashtag_click\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"\">$TREVEE</a> tokens are natively deployed on Sonic and are also available on Ethereum  Plasma via LayerZero, with plans to expand to additional chains. Bridge on Stargate</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/search?q=%24TREVEE&amp;src=cashtag_click\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"\">$TREVEE</a>&#x27;s new tokenomics introduces a Safety Module! Stake <a href=\"https://x.com/search?q=%24TREVEE&amp;src=cashtag_click\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"\">$TREVEE</a> for Value Accrual from dApps Excess Revenue, with mandatory governance participation or delegation. Up to 30% slashing for security events. Earn now targets ~110% collateralization with <a href=\"https://x.com/search?q=%24scUSD&amp;src=cashtag_click\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"\">$scUSD</a>, <a href=\"https://x.com/search?q=%24plUSD&amp;src=cashtag_click\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"\">$plUSD</a> &amp; <a href=\"https://x.com/search?q=%24TREVEE&amp;src=cashtag_click\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"\">$TREVEE</a>!</p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/images/image-DG1PqJ-84eec260feb31efedc9272b5fad692c6.png\" width=\"1518\" height=\"847\" class=\"img_ev3q\"></p>\n<p>The new Tokenomic also include the Reservoir mechanism: A sustainable emission flywheel! Dynamically drip 1% of reserve weekly (no fixed cap), replenished by Trevee Quest revenue buybacks to counter sell pressure.</p>\n<p>Ties growth to revenue for long-term reflexivity. No more dilution!</p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/images/image-w0mw7w-20b23053d8246d11154eb61aaf759edf.png\" width=\"940\" height=\"750\" class=\"img_ev3q\"></p>\n<p>The <a href=\"https://x.com/search?q=%24TREVEE&amp;src=cashtag_click\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"\">$TREVEE</a> Token is available to trade on <a href=\"https://beets.fi/pools/sonic/v3/0x802e7175e8f2168f15b0cc57540169c61d63c9d4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"\">Beets </a>(Sonic) an <a href=\"https://lithos.to/pools/deposit?pool=0xc8319a16ae5ab41c2d715bd65045c9473b0ec4e0&amp;__cf_chl_tk=DrXSbtpyNZeVsS2azFFSAiNdWrFvYl9FjJ2ZwFoj6LQ-1760974364-1.0.1.1-mswwgyf_eOAWoIFX.4_Ovrdw3SdCcSmoHVY4WZwXcdA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"\">Lithos </a>(Plasma)</p>\n<hr>\n<p>Tokenomic Proposal: <a href=\"https://gov.paladin.vote/t/pip-30-restructuring-paladin-tokenomics/617\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"\">https://gov.paladin.vote/t/pip-30-restructuring-paladin-tokenomics/617</a></p>\n<p>Migration Proposal: <a href=\"https://gov.paladin.vote/t/pip-28-restructuring-paladin-migration/603\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"\">https://gov.paladin.vote/t/pip-28-restructuring-paladin-migration/603</a></p></div></article><nav class=\"docusaurus-mt-lg pagination-nav\" aria-label=\"Docs pages\"><a class=\"pagination-nav__link pagination-nav__link--prev\" href=\"/trevee-c/building...\"><div class=\"pagination-nav__sublabel\">Previous</div><div class=\"pagination-nav__label\">BUILDING...</div></a><a class=\"pagination-nav__link pagination-nav__link--next\" href=\"/trevee-token/governance\"><div class=\"pagination-nav__sublabel\">Next</div><div class=\"pagination-nav__label\">Governance</div></a></nav></div></div><div class=\"col col--3\"><div class=\"tableOfContents_bqdL thin-scrollbar theme-doc-toc-desktop\"><ul class=\"table-of-contents table-of-contents__left-border\"><li><a href=\"#migrate-now-on-httpmigrationtreveexyz-\" class=\"table-of-contents__link toc-highlight\">Migrate now on http://migration.trevee.xyz</a></li></ul></div></div></div></div></main></div></div></div><footer class=\"theme-layout-footer footer footer--dark\"><div class=\"container container-fluid\"><div class=\"row footer__links\"><div class=\"theme-layout-footer-column col footer__col\"><div class=\"footer__title\">Product</div><ul class=\"footer__items clean-list\"><li class=\"footer__item\"><a class=\"footer__link-item\" href=\"/trevee-earn/overview\">Trevee Earn</a></li><li class=\"footer__item\"><a class=\"footer__link-item\" href=\"/trevee-quest/overview\">Trevee Quest</a></li><li class=\"footer__item\"><a class=\"footer__link-item\" href=\"/trevee-token/tokenomic-migration\">TREVEE Token</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"theme-layout-footer-column col footer__col\"><div class=\"footer__title\">Community</div><ul class=\"footer__items clean-list\"><li class=\"footer__item\"><a href=\"https://x.com/Trevee_xyz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"footer__link-item\">Twitter / X<svg width=\"13.5\" height=\"13.5\" aria-label=\"(opens in new tab)\" class=\"iconExternalLink_nPIU\"><use href=\"#theme-svg-external-link\"></use></svg></a></li><li class=\"footer__item\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/8kxeQVQQKf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"footer__link-item\">Discord<svg width=\"13.5\" height=\"13.5\" aria-label=\"(opens in new tab)\" class=\"iconExternalLink_nPIU\"><use href=\"#theme-svg-external-link\"></use></svg></a></li><li class=\"footer__item\"><a href=\"https://x.com/PMithras_Labs\" target=\"_blank\" rel